t 12, the Codington County record runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, across 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, and May to June did it in 26. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 172% of normal in June to July and 32% in January to February. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 30133 at 40% of normal.</p>"}
